{"seq":2,"slug":"lithium-battery-systems","title":"锂电池体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/lithium-battery-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cathode-material-routes","title":"正极材料路线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/lithium-battery-systems/cathode-material-routes","wordCount":2245,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"anode-electrolyte-evolution","title":"负极与电解液演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/lithium-battery-systems/anode-electrolyte-evolution","wordCount":2376,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-integration-engineering","title":"系统集成工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/battery-technology/lithium-battery-systems/system-integration-engineering","wordCount":2130,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"锂电池体系\">锂电池体系</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>锂离子电池自 1991 年商业化以来已成为动力电池与消费电子的绝对主流。本章覆盖正极材料的技术路线竞争、负极与电解液的迭代方向，以及从单体电芯到系统集成的工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>正极材料路线</td>\n<td>NCM/NCA三元、LFP磷酸铁锂、LMFP锰铁锂、富锂锰基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>负极与电解液演进</td>\n<td>石墨、硅基负极、硬碳；液态/凝胶/固态电解质过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>系统集成工程</td>\n<td>BMS架构、热管理（液冷/相变）、CTP/CTC/CTB结构、安全设计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>NCM（镍钴锰）</strong>：高能量密度三元正极材料，按镍占比分 NCM523/622/811</li>\n<li><strong>LFP（磷酸铁锂）</strong>：安全性好、循环寿命长，成本低，能量密度较三元低</li>\n<li><strong>CTP（Cell-to-Pack）</strong>：跳过模组直接将电芯集成到电池包的结构设计</li>\n</ul>\n"}